@ddd.aggregate-root

Purpose:
  Entry point to aggregate.

Owns: references\ddd\aggregate-root.sdd
UseWhen:
  - aggregate exists
  - external access needed
  - invariants must be enforced

AvoidWhen:
  - no aggregate boundary
  - simple entity without aggregate

Why:
  Only the root can be directly referenced from outside the aggregate.

Related:
  @ddd.aggregate
  @ddd.entity

Examples:
  @project.payment
  @project.order

State: +
